} -result {0 0 continue 1 steam}

test request-5 {Cached preceding completion cannot finalize a fresh Start before native observation} -setup {
    ::lifecycle_fixture::ready
    ::lifecycle_fixture::active
    ::lifecycle_fixture::finalized
    ::aiden::lifecycle::continue
    ::aiden::lifecycle::request start
} -body {
